    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44488" root="&#xA;                        وخف&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَخَفَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He beat it</i> (namely <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِطْمِىّ</span>, IDrd, K,
and in like manner <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوِيق</span>, IDrd) <i>with his hand,
and moistened it in a</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طشت</span> [or <i>basin</i>], (TA,)
<i>until it became viscous,</i> or <i>cohesive,</i> (K, TA,)
<i>and became</i> [<i>fit for</i>] <i>food;</i> (TA;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْخَفَهُ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَخَّفَهُ</span></b> . (TA.)

